  "E11": "analysis/ableton-live-12.4.3/r2/n7-midi-transforms-v1/results/n7-0002 0x1026094e0 (keys (ch, n, 5) -> type 5 and (ch, n+32, 5) -> type 6; receiver flag `mov w3,#0x0` at 0x102609548), 0x101b8028c MSB store, 0x101b802bc LSB store, 0x101b7fcc0 combine ((MSB<<7|LSB)/129.0, constant 0x10584a8b4; MapMode 0, sensitivity 1.0; all four slots reset)",
