  "E13": "analysis/ableton-live-12.4.3/r2/n7-midi-transforms-v1/results/n7-0003 0x1026fa5c8, 0x1026fa684 (Type 1 ATimeableFloat, 2 Bool, 3 Enum, 0 other; Min/Max; Quantized); results/n7-0001 0x101b7fde4 apply (Type 2 branch; otherwise value function, then takeover only for MapMode 0/5, Type 1 and prior != FLT_MAX); results/n7-0002 0x101b7f894 CC receiver (prior := FLT_MAX when avoid and Zoom 1.0; quantized relative accumulator +-s, fires at |acc| >= 1)",
